    "testimonials_banner_mUptUN": {
      "type": "testimonials-banner",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_8Eexjc": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "text": "<p>There's mine. I've used it twice for 2 nights in a row. I read the instructions and I used it once facing one way for 15 minutes or when it stopped. Then I used it again facing the other way. Wow, I can really tell! Good so far.<br/></p>",
            "author": "Nick W.",
            "author_info": "",
            "author_url": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/9ba96aec-33f0-416e-8ed1-06609d0cad28.webp",
            "image_ratio": "rounded",
            "image_height": 30,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_7TegmL": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "4-stars",
            "text": "<p>I’ve had neck pain for 2.5 years with little relief. It complements my stretching routine well, but avoid overuse — too much triggers inflammation for me. Best with selective use; temperature and timer controls are simple.</p>",
            "author": "Bobby",
            "author_info": "",
            "author_url": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/20260521224127_310_75_e9cbb892-5677-430c-8bb0-7da30dffd830.png",
            "image_ratio": "rounded",
            "image_height": 30,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_yXgWEd": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "text": "<p>Nice neck support. The heat really helps relieving my muscle soreness, better effect than my other neck massager. I usually go with medium heat; the high heat can be a bit too strong on bare skin. Love the timer too so that I can totally relax without worrying about falling asleep with the heat on.</p>",
            "author": "Liam",
            "author_info": "",
            "author_url": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/20260521224119_309_75_8d2b099c-731f-47fc-abe6-277c0c9abe69.png",
            "image_ratio": "rounded",
            "image_height": 30,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_4dXdMz": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "text": "<p>8 years of programming left me with neck tension that turned into arm pain and headaches. Nothing I tried helped — until QuestProps. It reversed years of strain in just 2 weeks. You’ll feel a difference day one, stick with it for two weeks for full results.</p>",
            "author": "Martha S.",
            "author_info": "",
            "author_url": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/20260521224109_308_75_db166abe-3a52-4294-bb11-b2a61d4a323e.png",
            "image_ratio": "rounded",
            "image_height": 30,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
